00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:08.170
Bobby Ray Schaefer.
鲍比·雷·谢弗。

349
00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:08.830
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

350
00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:09.370
Mm.
嗯。

351
