So the documentary crew clocks this, and then they go back to talk to Bob.
所以纪录片摄制组注意到了这一点，然后他们回去找鲍勃谈话。

377
00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:07.930
Yeah.
对。

378
00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:12.710
He's going to get on his computer, and he's going to explain that Dundra Mifflin was purchased
他打开电脑，准备解释说登德拉·米夫林是在2019年

