00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:14.310
Here's my question.
我的问题来了。

403
00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:14.810
Yes.
请讲。

404
00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.770
Does Dwight still own the Scranton Park, though?
不过德怀特现在还拥有斯克兰顿商业园吗？

405
00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.250
Oh, does he still own the building?
哦，他还在那栋大楼里有产权吗？

406
00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:22.630
Yeah, because he bought the whole building.
对，因为他买下了整栋楼。

407
00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:23.610
You're right.
你说的对。

408
00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:24.370
Yeah.
对。

409
00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.690
We don't know the answer to that right now.
我们现在还不知道答案。

410
00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:27.030
We don't.
确实不知道。

411
00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:27.690
Mm-mm.
嗯嗯。

412
00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.570
I secretly hope he does.
我暗自希望他还拥有。

413
00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:35.810
Well, I just loved that the show opens with a familiar face.
好吧，我特别喜欢节目一开场就是一个熟悉的面孔。

414
00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:40.690
I love hearing that Stanley and Phyllis both have schnoodles.
我很高兴听到斯坦利和菲利丝都养了雪纳多犬。

415
00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:44.650
You know, I was just sort of on the edge of my seat when I saw Bobby.
你知道的，我看到鲍比的时候简直激动得坐立难安。

416
00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:45.070
I know.
就是说啊。

417
00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:47.050
We did not know he was part of the show.
我们之前根本不知道他也参演了。

418
00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:50.070
