1258
01:00:36.560 --> 01:00:38.940
I really love Detrick in that scene.
我真的很喜欢那场戏里的德特里克。

1259
01:00:39.100 --> 01:00:39.540
Yes.
对。

1260
01:00:39.740 --> 01:00:40.500
He's so great.
