us about her deskmate, Adam.
向我们讲述她的邻座同事亚当。

1399
01:06:07.020 --> 01:06:08.480
He has four kids.
他有四个孩子。

1400
01:06:09.140 --> 01:06:11.500
His wife makes him the same lunch every day.
他妻子每天都给他带同样的午餐。

1401
01:06:12.100 --> 01:06:15.000
He basically eats whatever the kids don't want to eat.
他基本上吃的就是孩子们不愿吃的东西。

1402
01:06:15.520 --> 01:06:19.040
And I guess you could say I'm not sure she thinks very highly of him.
我想你可以说，我觉得她对他的评价其实不高。

1403
01:06:19.340 --> 01:06:24.400
While she's saying all of this, it's so hilarious to me because they cut to Adam.
当她说这些的时候，我真的觉得太搞笑了，因为镜头切到了亚当身上。

1404
01:06:24.400 --> 01:06:27.960
He is drinking out of a dinosaur sippy cup.
他正在用一个恐龙学饮杯喝水。

1405
01:06:28.380 --> 01:06:30.820
He's like literally eating a kid's lunch.
他简直就像是在吃小孩子的午餐。

1406
01:06:31.100 --> 01:06:32.140
It's really funny.
这真的很好笑。

1407
01:06:32.480 --> 01:06:37.760
We see a little bit of both of their desks in this montage, and I thought I'd share with
在这个混剪中，我们看到了他们两人的部分办公桌，我想和大家分享一下。

1408
01:06:37.760 --> 01:06:37.960
you.
你们。

1409
01:06:38.420 --> 01:06:42.380
First of all, Adalola's desk, she's got a lot on her desk.
首先是阿达洛拉的桌子，她桌上的东西可真不少。

1410
01:06:42.660 --> 01:06:44.980
She's got a lot of papers, a lot of things.
她有好多文件，还有各种各样的小物件。

1411
01:06:45.100 --> 01:06:45.960
It's a little messy.
稍微有点乱。

1412
01:06:46.280 --> 01:06:51.400
But I think she's where people go to get little treats because on the front of her desk,
但我觉得大家都会去她那儿拿点小零食，因为在她的桌子前面，

1413
