然后我抬头一看，每个人都在看着我。

1447
01:08:26.420 --> 01:08:28.040
It was the wrong kind of attention.
那是那种不太妙的关注。

1448
01:08:29.140 --> 01:08:31.860
I have a question about this Boston snow globe.
我关于这个波士顿水晶球有个问题。

1449
01:08:32.080 --> 01:08:35.360
Is your character, does your character have a Boston backstory?
你的角色，你的角色是有波士顿的背景故事吗？

1450
01:08:35.360 --> 01:08:38.720
My character, like me, does have a Boston backstory.
我的角色和我一样，确实有个波士顿的背景故事。

1451
01:08:38.960 --> 01:08:41.920
I'm from, I'm a proud Brookline, Massachusettsan.
我来自，我是一个骄傲的马萨诸塞州布鲁克莱恩人。

1452
01:08:42.860 --> 01:08:45.900
Not a Newtonian, like Novak and Krasinski,
不是纽顿人，不像诺瓦克和卡拉辛斯基那样，

1453
01:08:47.240 --> 01:08:51.400
but it's a bit of a tribute to all of the Bostonians
但这算是一个致敬，献给所有波士顿人

1454
01:08:51.400 --> 01:08:52.520
who have come through the show.
他们曾参与过这部剧。

1455
01:08:53.040 --> 01:08:57.960
And, yeah, my character is from Boston originally,
而且，是的，我的角色原本来自波士顿，

1456
01:08:58.200 --> 01:08:59.200
although it's never come up.
尽管剧中从未提过。

1457
01:08:59.960 --> 01:09:04.600
I see that you also have the Magic 8-Ball on your desk,
我看到你的桌上也放着魔法8号球，

1458
01:09:04.780 --> 01:09:07.820
which was in Michael Scott's office,
它曾在迈克尔·斯科特的办公室里出现过，

1459
01:09:08.120 --> 01:09:12.360
and a Magic 8-Ball seems to find its way onto a desk
而且魔法8号球似乎总能摆到办公桌上

1460
01:09:12.360 --> 01:09:14.180
in every iteration of the office.
在《办公室》的每一个版本里。

1461
01:09:14.400 --> 01:09:15.840
So, you know, that wasn't my choice,
所以，你知道，那不是我选择的，

1462
01:09:15.920 --> 01:09:17.100
but when I noticed it,
但当我注意到它时，

1463
01:09:17.720 --> 01:09:20.120
I kept hoping that no one would call me on it
我一直希望没有人会因此质疑我

1464
01:09:20.120 --> 01:09:21.980
because I really wanted to keep it
因为我真的很想把它留下

1465
01:09:21.980 --> 01:09:24.260
because I was such a big fan of the original show.
因为我是原版剧集的超级粉丝。

1466
01:09:24.860 --> 01:09:32.000
And so I thought, oh, man, Oscar has his little nod to Michael Scott.
所以我当时想，天哪，奥斯卡对迈克尔·斯科特有致敬的小心思。

1467
01:09:32.320 --> 01:09:35.900
I love that I get to have a little tiny nod to Michael Scott, too.
我也很喜欢自己能对迈克尔·斯科特有一个小小的致敬。

1468
01:09:36.000 --> 01:09:36.720
But there are so many.
但这里还有很多其他的。

1469
01:09:36.840 --> 01:09:38.900
Yes, I have a bevy of chapsticks.
是的，我有很多润唇膏。

1470
01:09:39.660 --> 01:09:40.820
I have lots of chapsticks.
我有很多很多润唇膏。

1471
01:09:40.960 --> 01:09:44.760
And this is a ball signed by a bunch of the crew,
这是个由许多剧组成员签名过的球，

1472
01:09:44.980 --> 01:09:48.180
which is a really nice, nice thing to have.
拥有这样一个纪念品真的很棒、很贴心。

1473
01:09:48.760 --> 01:09:50.340
And, yeah, there are lots of little nods
而且，是的，办公室里有很多

1474
01:09:50.340 --> 01:09:51.300
to the crew around the office.
献给幕后工作人员的小巧思。

1475
01:09:51.300 --> 01:09:55.640
A lot of the employees of the month are the, yeah, a lot of the plaques.
很多本月之星其实是，对，有很多这样的牌匾。

1476
01:09:55.760 --> 01:09:57.460
And, like, it's a really fun set.
而且，这个片场真的很有趣。

1477
01:09:58.580 --> 01:09:59.500
Isn't that great?
不是很棒吗？

1478
01:09:59.680 --> 01:09:59.900
Yeah.
是啊。

1479
01:10:00.120 --> 01:10:02.160
He also went on to show us all the pictures
他还接着向我们展示了所有的照片

1480
01:10:02.160 --> 01:10:04.160
that are, quote, unquote, all of his mini kids.
也就是所谓的，他所有的“迷你孩子们”。

1481
01:10:04.380 --> 01:10:06.780
And they're just all of his friends' kids.
那些其实全都是他朋友的孩子。

1482
01:10:07.000 --> 01:10:07.220
Yeah.
对的。

1483
01:10:07.220 --> 01:10:09.380
Like, people that he holds dear to his heart.
就像是他放在心上的人们。

1484
01:10:09.800 --> 01:10:11.500
But his desk had so many toys.
但他的桌上有太多的玩具了。

1485
01:10:11.600 --> 01:10:14.640
It had a marble racer, had all these things.
有弹珠滑道，还有各种各样的东西。

1486
01:10:14.660 --> 01:10:18.440
But I loved hearing how there was a little bit of things from his life,
但我很高兴听到其中融入了他生活中的一些东西，

1487
01:10:18.440 --> 01:10:21.880
plus things that are props, plus nods to the office.
再加上各种道具，以及对《办公室》的致敬。

1488
01:10:22.160 --> 01:10:25.520
And I also just love how they continued the tradition,
而且我也很喜欢他们延续了这个传统，

1489
01:10:25.520 --> 01:10:26.860
like we had on the office,
就像我们当年拍《办公室》时一样，

1490
01:10:26.980 --> 01:10:30.340
of having crew featured in all these little places on plaques and things.
让剧组工作人员的名字出现在这些小地方的牌匾和其他物品上。

1491
01:10:30.460 --> 01:10:31.300
I love that, too.
我也很喜欢这一点。

1492
01:10:32.060 --> 01:10:33.900
Well, now we're going back to lunch.
好了，现在我们要回去吃午饭了。

1493
01:10:33.960 --> 01:10:35.860
And now it's Mayor's turn to open up.
接下来轮到梅尔开诚布公了。

1494
01:10:36.040 --> 01:10:37.900
And they're going to kind of agree together
他们会达成某种共识

1495
01:10:37.900 --> 01:10:39.860
that this paper sucks,
那就是这家造纸厂烂透了，

1496
01:10:39.880 --> 01:10:41.860
but maybe they can make it better.
但或许他们能让它变好一些。

1497
01:10:42.360 --> 01:10:44.540
Maybe it can be a real paper.
或许它能成为一家真正的报社。

1498
01:10:44.880 --> 01:10:45.120
Yeah.
是的。

1499
01:10:45.380 --> 01:10:46.440
But in order to do that,
但为了做到这一点，

1500
01:10:46.580 --> 01:10:48.400
Ned is going to have to meet Esmeralda.
内德将不得不去见埃斯梅拉达。

1501
01:10:48.600 --> 01:10:51.380
And he's going to have to tell her
而他不得不告诉她

1502
01:10:51.380 --> 01:10:53.680
that he is taking her job.
他要接替她的工作。

1503
01:10:53.860 --> 01:10:54.340
Yeah.
是啊。

1504
01:10:54.480 --> 01:10:55.960
He's editor-in-chief now.
他现在是总编辑了。

1505
01:10:56.120 --> 01:10:58.140
She can still run the online part.
她仍然可以管理网络部门。

1506
01:10:58.320 --> 01:11:01.140
But he's going to basically replace her.
但基本上他要取代她。

1507
01:11:01.660 --> 01:11:02.140
Yeah.
对。

1508
01:11:02.300 --> 01:11:04.340
He's in charge of the print paper now.
他现在负责纸质报纸了。

1509
01:11:04.520 --> 01:11:06.380
And he makes this apology to her.
然后他向她道歉。

1510
01:11:06.480 --> 01:11:06.660
He's like,
他说，

1511
01:11:06.680 --> 01:11:07.080
I'm sorry.
我很抱歉。

1512
01:11:07.080 --> 01:11:09.640
I hope me coming in here and changing things up
我希望我来这里改变现状

1513
01:11:09.640 --> 01:11:10.780
won't be too disruptive.
不会造成太大的干扰。

1514
01:11:10.780 --> 01:11:11.880
And she says,
她说，

1515
01:11:12.040 --> 01:11:13.780
oh, don't be so self-defecating.
哦，别这么妄自尊大又出丑了。

1516
01:11:14.200 --> 01:11:14.600
Yes.
没错。

1517
01:11:16.260 --> 01:11:19.440
She is just clearly has him in her bullseye.
很显然，她已经把他当成了眼中钉。

1518
01:11:19.580 --> 01:11:22.280
And now she is going to just start taking jabs at him
现在她要开始向他发起挑衅

1519
01:11:22.280 --> 01:11:24.200
in all the tiniest and big ways.
通过所有大大小小的方式。

1520
01:11:25.020 --> 01:11:25.500
Yeah.
是的。

1521
01:11:25.700 --> 01:11:28.260
There's going to be some future storylines that play out
未来的剧情发展中

1522
01:11:28.260 --> 01:11:32.420
that are just her really, like, undermining him.
会有她真正暗中破坏他的情节。

1523
01:11:32.540 --> 01:11:35.420
But she pretends like...
但她假装……

1524
01:11:35.420 --> 01:11:36.280
She's in his corner.
她是站在他这边的。

1525
01:11:36.540 --> 01:11:38.740
Oh, it's just lost in translation, maybe.
哦，也许只是翻译上的误解。

1526
01:11:39.000 --> 01:11:39.720
Like, I...
比如，我……

1527
01:11:39.720 --> 01:11:39.920
Oh.
哦。

1528
01:11:40.440 --> 01:11:41.900
There's one coming up, actually.
实际上，马上就会有一个。

1529
01:11:42.260 --> 01:11:43.360
Well, I also want to say,
嗯，我还想说，

1530
01:11:43.460 --> 01:11:45.460
I just love that she's holding her cell phone in the scene.
我特别喜欢她在这一幕里一直拿着手机。

1531
01:11:45.560 --> 01:11:46.700
It's just so true to character.
这太符合她的性格了。

1532
01:11:46.880 --> 01:11:48.740
This is totally a person who walks around
这完全就是一个整天

1533
01:11:48.740 --> 01:11:50.500
with their cell phone in their hand all the time.
手里拿着手机到处走的人。

1534
01:11:50.500 --> 01:11:51.320
And she does.
她确实是这样。

1535
01:11:51.460 --> 01:11:52.000
And I love it.
我太喜欢了。

1536
01:11:52.200 --> 01:11:55.300
We are now going to have our first conference room scene.
我们现在要迎来第一个会议室场景。

1537
01:11:55.860 --> 01:11:56.260
Yes.
对。

1538
01:11:56.820 --> 01:11:59.700
It's just between Ned and Ken,
只有内德和肯，

1539
01:11:59.940 --> 01:12:01.520
who is the guy we met at the beginning,
也就是我们在开头遇到的那个人，

1540
01:12:01.520 --> 01:12:04.320
who works for Enervate and Esmeralda.
他为埃内尔韦特和埃斯梅拉达工作。

1541
01:12:04.320 --> 01:12:05.960
And basically, Ned is saying,
基本上，内德是在说，

1542
01:12:06.100 --> 01:12:08.040
listen, I'm going to need a few things
听着，我需要几样东西

1543
01:12:08.040 --> 01:12:10.280
to make the kind of newspaper I want to make.
来办出我想要的那种报纸。

1544
01:12:10.540 --> 01:12:12.320
I'm going to need a full staff,
我需要一个完整的员工团队，

1545
01:12:12.560 --> 01:12:15.680
dedicated reporters on multiple beats.
在多个领域都有专职记者。

1546
01:12:15.700 --> 01:12:17.740
And Ken is like, whoopsies,
肯则一副糟糕了的表情，

1547
01:12:17.740 --> 01:12:20.920
I'm going to call 911 because our budget is having a coronary.
说我要打911了，因为我们的预算要心脏病发了。

1548
01:12:21.120 --> 01:12:22.720
And he says, you know what else?
然后他说，你知道还有什么吗？

1549
01:12:22.920 --> 01:12:24.940
I am going to cancel the wire service.
我要取消通讯社服务。

1550
01:12:24.940 --> 01:12:29.720
We are only going to print original articles from this point on.
从今以后我们只刊登原创文章。

1551
01:12:30.180 --> 01:12:32.200
Esmeralda looks right at the camera like,
埃丝梅拉达直勾勾地盯着镜头，那表情仿佛在说

1552
01:12:32.300 --> 01:12:34.280
who the F is this a-hole?
这混蛋到底是谁啊？

1553
01:12:34.480 --> 01:12:35.000
I know.
我知道。

1554
01:12:35.620 --> 01:12:37.940
Now, meanwhile, during this conference room scene,
好，与此同时，在这个会议室的场景里

1555
01:12:38.160 --> 01:12:40.560
we see everyone out in the bullpen
我们看到外面的大办公区里所有人

1556
01:12:40.560 --> 01:12:42.380
getting an email on their computers.
电脑上都收到了一封邮件。

1557
01:12:42.760 --> 01:12:44.360
It's from Esmeralda.
发件人是埃丝梅拉达。

1558
01:12:44.380 --> 01:12:45.580
Well, she's been clicking away.
没错，她一直在那儿狂点个不停。

1559
01:12:45.580 --> 01:12:48.320
As soon as he started telling her the wire was going away
就在他开始告诉她要取消有线业务

1560
01:12:48.320 --> 01:12:49.800
and how he was going to change things,
以及他打算如何改变现状的时候

1561
01:12:49.960 --> 01:12:52.180
she is busy on her phone during this meeting.
她在这场会议期间一直忙着玩手机。

1562
01:12:52.180 --> 01:12:55.940
And what she's been doing is writing a letter to the staff
她一直在做的事是给全体员工写了一封信

1563
01:12:56.340 --> 01:12:58.220
titled, Welcome, Ned Sampson.
标题是：欢迎你，内德·桑普森。

1564
01:12:58.380 --> 01:13:01.020
And we're going to see people reading it.
然后我们会看到大家都在阅读这封信。

1565
01:13:01.140 --> 01:13:04.340
And one by one, people kind of start like coming over
大家开始一个接一个地走过来

1566
01:13:04.340 --> 01:13:05.580
and looking in the room.
往会议室里张望。

1567
01:13:05.960 --> 01:13:08.620
Yeah, one guy comes over to the conference room
对，有个家伙走到会议室门口

1568
01:13:08.620 --> 01:13:10.700
and is like, hey, I'm here for you, guy.
来了句：嘿，我挺你，兄弟。

1569
01:13:11.020 --> 01:13:12.320
You know, same thing happened to me.
你知道的，我以前也经历过这种事。

1570
01:13:12.500 --> 01:13:14.120
We're here to show you my support.
我们来这儿就是为了向你表达我的支持。

1571
01:13:14.120 --> 01:13:14.900
And he leaves.
然后他就走了。

1572
01:13:16.040 --> 01:13:18.220
And everyone's kind of like, what was that about?
大家都有点摸不着头脑：刚才那是怎么回事？

1573
01:13:18.300 --> 01:13:20.580
And Ken goes, I didn't even think that guy worked here anymore.
肯接着说道：我都不知道那家伙是不是还在我们这儿上班。

1574
01:13:22.180 --> 01:13:24.500
Everyone else starts to walk up to the conference room
其他人开始朝会议室走去

1575
01:13:24.500 --> 01:13:26.080
and there are these glass windows
那边有一些玻璃窗

1576
01:13:26.080 --> 01:13:28.680
and they're looking through it pretty harshly at Ned.
他们透过玻璃冷冷地打量着内德。

1577
01:13:28.960 --> 01:13:29.820
They are not happy.
他们很不高兴。

1578
01:13:30.320 --> 01:13:33.500
Ken is oblivious, but you can tell Esmeralda is delighted.
肯还一无所知，但你能看出埃丝梅拉达得意极了。

1579
01:13:33.860 --> 01:13:35.540
Well, Ned is going to excuse himself
好，接下来内德打算告辞

1580
01:13:35.540 --> 01:13:38.140
and Mare is going to show him something on her phone.
而梅尔要给他看手机上的一个东西。

1581
01:13:38.440 --> 01:13:39.840
It is the email.
就是那封邮件。

1582
01:13:40.520 --> 01:13:42.260
And here's what it is.
内容是这样的。

1583
01:13:43.120 --> 01:13:45.660
Esmeralda has sent an email to everyone
埃丝梅拉达给所有人群发了一封邮件

1584
01:13:46.820 --> 01:13:51.280
explaining that Ned has not been Me Too'd.
解释说内德并没有遭遇“我也是”运动（Me Too）。

1585
01:13:52.840 --> 01:13:55.460
That's not why he came here, why he had to get a new job.
他来这儿、他不得不找一份新工作并不是因为这个原因。

1586
01:13:55.500 --> 01:13:57.480
It was not because he was Me Too'd.
不是因为他被Me Too了。

1587
01:13:57.700 --> 01:13:58.200
Yes.
是的。

1588
01:13:58.340 --> 01:14:00.980
So he has this conversation with Esmeralda
于是他和埃丝梅拉达展开了一段对话

1589
01:14:01.500 --> 01:14:04.040
where he's like, why would you send an email
大意是：你为什么要发邮件

1590
01:14:04.040 --> 01:14:06.340
telling people that I was not something,
告诉大家我不是某种人

1591
01:14:06.620 --> 01:14:08.520
that I was not Me Too'd?
我没有被Me Too呢？

1592
01:14:09.300 --> 01:14:11.040
Her explanation is so funny.
她的解释太搞笑了。

1593
01:14:11.180 --> 01:14:12.360
She's being so manipulative.
她太会操纵人心了。

1594
01:14:12.440 --> 01:14:13.480
It's amazing.
绝了。

1595
01:14:13.480 --> 01:14:14.840
I think we should hear it.
我觉得我们应该听听。

1596
01:14:16.500 --> 01:14:17.880
Hey, can we talk?
嘿，能聊聊吗？

1597
01:14:18.440 --> 01:14:18.860
Of course.
当然。

1598
01:14:19.080 --> 01:14:19.320
No.
不。

1599
01:14:19.520 --> 01:14:19.680
No.
不。

1600
01:14:20.600 --> 01:14:20.920
Her.
她。

1601
01:14:22.260 --> 01:14:24.660
Did you send an email to everyone here
你是不是给这里的每个人都发了邮件

1602
01:14:25.920 --> 01:14:27.820
saying that I was not Me Too'd?
说我没有卷入“我也是”运动？

1603
01:14:28.780 --> 01:14:32.560
Yes, because I didn't want you to start off on the wrong foot.
对啊，因为我不想让你一开始就留下坏印象。

1604
01:14:34.440 --> 01:14:35.480
But I wasn't.
但我根本没有。

1605
01:14:36.800 --> 01:14:41.280
Yes, in fact, that's why I said he was not Me Too'd.
对，事实上，这就是为什么我说他没有卷入“我也是”运动。

1606
01:14:41.360 --> 01:14:42.020
I don't think.
我不觉得。

1607
01:14:42.280 --> 01:14:43.180
I was not.
我没有。

1608
01:14:43.260 --> 01:14:44.680
I've never been Me Too'd.
我从来没有卷入过“我也是”运动。

1609
01:14:45.700 --> 01:14:48.680
I've also never embezzled or slapped a waitress.
我也从来没有挪用公款或者扇过女服务员耳光。

1610
01:14:48.840 --> 01:14:50.360
Oh, well, should I tell them?
哦，那我是不是应该告诉他们一声？

1611
01:14:51.220 --> 01:14:51.420
Maybe.
也许吧。

1612
01:14:51.420 --> 01:14:51.680
No.
不。

1613
01:14:52.020 --> 01:14:53.160
That's what I'm saying.
这就是我想说的。

1614
01:14:53.920 --> 01:14:56.720
You don't have to knot a thing that isn't.
没影的事你不用去特意澄清。

1615
01:14:56.880 --> 01:14:58.360
You are preaching to the choir.
你这是在对听众说教。

1616
01:14:58.740 --> 01:15:00.420
These are simple people.
这些人很单纯。

1617
01:15:00.740 --> 01:15:03.180
To them, a man leaves his job,
对他们来说，如果一个男人离职了，

1618
01:15:03.440 --> 01:15:04.720
moves to a new town.
搬到一个新城镇，

1619
01:15:05.120 --> 01:15:05.680
They think,
他们就会想，

1620
01:15:05.680 --> 01:15:08.780
I wonder what was his evil crime.
天哪，他到底犯了什么滔天大罪。

1621
01:15:09.200 --> 01:15:10.920
Did he do it to a person?
他是对人下手了吗？

1622
01:15:11.440 --> 01:15:12.300
An animal?
还是对动物？

1623
01:15:12.620 --> 01:15:13.060
An animal?
动物？

1624
01:15:13.180 --> 01:15:14.620
I hope he doesn't do it to me.
我希望他别对我下手。

1625
01:15:14.620 --> 01:15:18.440
That's why I wrote a mass email to everyone
这就是为什么我给所有人群发了一封邮件

1626
01:15:18.440 --> 01:15:19.960
so instead they would think,
这样他们转而就会想，

1627
01:15:20.260 --> 01:15:20.760
wait a minute,
等一下，

1628
01:15:21.020 --> 01:15:21.740
hold on.
慢着。

1629
01:15:21.980 --> 01:15:23.400
Maybe I should wait and see.
也许我应该观望一下。

1630
01:15:23.600 --> 01:15:26.320
What if my gut instinct against him
万一我对他的直觉

1631
01:15:26.320 --> 01:15:28.960
is not completely, completely, completely right?
并不是完全、绝对、百分之百正确呢？

1632
01:15:29.160 --> 01:15:31.680
Okay, this is bad, Esmeralda.
好吧，这太糟糕了，埃斯梅拉达。

1633
01:15:31.680 --> 01:15:32.560
You know what?
你知道吗？

1634
01:15:32.700 --> 01:15:34.140
I'm going to tell everyone
我要告诉大家

1635
01:15:34.140 --> 01:15:36.700
that everything that I wrote in that email
我在那封邮件里写的内容

1636
01:15:36.700 --> 01:15:38.320
was completely incorrect.
完全是错误的。

1637
01:15:38.640 --> 01:15:39.020
Okay?
好吗？

1638
01:15:39.400 --> 01:15:39.740
Thank you.
谢谢。

1639
01:15:39.820 --> 01:15:40.520
Okay, you're welcome.
好的，不客气。

1640
01:15:40.780 --> 01:15:41.200
You're welcome.
不客气。

1641
01:15:42.280 --> 01:15:44.020
No, wait, wait, wait.
不，等等，等等，等等。

1642
01:15:44.420 --> 01:15:45.380
I think that's worse.
我觉得那样更糟。

1643
01:15:46.120 --> 01:15:46.520
Why?
为什么？

1644
01:15:46.780 --> 01:15:47.020
Why?
为什么？

1645
01:15:47.820 --> 01:15:50.120
I think it's better if it comes from me.
我觉得由我亲自出面说明会更好。

1646
01:15:50.460 --> 01:15:51.000
I agree.
我同意。

1647
01:15:51.200 --> 01:15:51.800
Great idea.
好主意。

1648
01:15:52.180 --> 01:15:53.940
Everybody's going to appreciate your remarks.
每个人都会感激你的这番话。

1649
01:15:54.160 --> 01:15:54.440
Cool.
太好了。

1650
01:15:55.280 --> 01:15:56.300
No, not now.
不，现在不行。

1651
01:15:56.760 --> 01:15:57.500
Not now.
现在不行。

1652
01:15:57.700 --> 01:15:58.160
Everyone.
所有人。

1653
01:15:59.220 --> 01:15:59.780
Everyone.
所有人。

1654
01:16:00.320 --> 01:16:00.780
Brilliant.
太棒了。

1655
01:16:08.140 --> 01:16:10.580
She is just a master class in acting
她的演技堪称教科书般精湛

1656
01:16:10.580 --> 01:16:13.900
and then her way she yells at everyone
接着她冲所有人大吼

1657
01:16:13.900 --> 01:16:15.160
to listen up.
让他们听着。

1658
01:16:15.280 --> 01:16:15.580
Everyone.
所有人。

1659
01:16:16.060 --> 01:16:17.360
It's so incredible.
真是不可思议。

1660
01:16:17.640 --> 01:16:18.320
So good.
太棒了。

1661
01:16:18.680 --> 01:16:20.360
Poor Ned is just deer in headlights.
可怜的内德简直像惊恐的小鹿。

1662
01:16:20.720 --> 01:16:21.280
Yes.
没错。

1663
01:16:21.600 --> 01:16:23.160
Well, he is in fact
嗯，事实上他

1664
01:16:23.160 --> 01:16:24.320
going to take the floor.
要发言了。

1665
01:16:24.540 --> 01:16:25.880
He's going to stand up
他要站起来

1666
01:16:25.880 --> 01:16:27.260
on one of the desks
踩在其中一张桌子上

1667
01:16:27.260 --> 01:16:28.580
in the middle of the bullpen.
就在大办公室的中间。

1668
01:16:28.880 --> 01:16:30.420
You know, this is the photo
你知道的，这就是这张照片

1669
01:16:30.420 --> 01:16:31.440
we've all been seeing.
我们都一直看到的。

1670
01:16:31.600 --> 01:16:33.620
They released a photo of this moment
他们在宣传这部剧时

1671
01:16:33.620 --> 01:16:35.320
when they were promoting the show.
发布了一张这个时刻的照片。

1672
01:16:35.440 --> 01:16:37.500
So this scene gives us
所以这个场景给我们呈现了

1673
01:16:37.500 --> 01:16:40.860
this really great wide shot of the offices.
这个非常棒的办公室全景镜头。

1674
01:16:41.140 --> 01:16:43.440
You can see Ned standing on top of the desk.
你能看到内德站在桌子顶上。

1675
01:16:43.540 --> 01:16:45.500
You can see the softy toilet paper side.
你能看到注重舒适的卫生纸那一侧。

1676
01:16:45.600 --> 01:16:47.140
You can see the truth teller side.
你能看到讲真话的那一侧。

1677
01:16:47.800 --> 01:16:49.480
And I have to give a shout out
我必须称赞一下

1678
01:16:49.480 --> 01:16:50.640
to the production designer,
布景设计师

1679
01:16:50.840 --> 01:16:51.760
Susie Mancini,
苏茜·曼奇尼，

1680
01:16:51.760 --> 01:16:54.800
who also worked with Greg on Space Force
她也曾和格雷格合作过《太空部队》

1681
01:16:54.800 --> 01:16:56.240
and Adrian Garcia,
还有阿德里安·加西亚，

1682
01:16:56.240 --> 01:16:57.840
who was the set decorator.
他是布景装饰师。

1683
01:16:58.540 --> 01:17:00.280
Greg and Michael shared with us
格雷格和迈克尔跟我们分享说

1684
01:17:00.280 --> 01:17:02.420
that in the same way that Greg visited
就像格雷格参观

1685
01:17:02.420 --> 01:17:03.780
like a small paper company
一家小型造纸公司一样

1686
01:17:03.780 --> 01:17:05.160
when he was developing the office,
当他在构思《办公室》时，

1687
01:17:05.780 --> 01:17:06.920
he and Michael visited
他和迈克尔参观了

1688
01:17:06.920 --> 01:17:08.880
several small newspaper offices
几家小型报社

1689
01:17:08.880 --> 01:17:09.640
in Ohio
在俄亥俄州

1690
01:17:09.640 --> 01:17:11.280
when they were developing the paper.
当他们在构思这家报社时。

1691
01:17:11.660 --> 01:17:13.060
And he said that
他说

1692
01:17:13.060 --> 01:17:14.160
something they noticed
他们注意到的一点是

1693
01:17:14.160 --> 01:17:15.700
was that these old offices,
这些老旧的办公室，

1694
01:17:15.700 --> 01:17:17.040
they have a lot of style
它们很有风格

1695
01:17:17.040 --> 01:17:19.480
because this was the big
因为这是当年的

1696
01:17:19.480 --> 01:17:21.240
like Google-type company
类似于谷歌那种大公司

1697
01:17:21.240 --> 01:17:22.100
of their era.
在他们那个时代。

1698
01:17:22.680 --> 01:17:24.060
And the set of the paper
报社的布景

1699
01:17:24.060 --> 01:17:25.740
is modeled after some of the things
是根据他们观察到的一些事物

1700
01:17:25.740 --> 01:17:26.560
that they observed
进行建模的

1701
01:17:26.560 --> 01:17:29.200
touring these historic newspaper offices.
参观这些历史悠久的报社办公室。

1702
01:17:29.580 --> 01:17:31.100
They wanted to create a place
他们想要打造一个地方

1703
01:17:31.100 --> 01:17:32.560
that felt like it had history.
感觉好像自带历史底蕴。

1704
01:17:32.600 --> 01:17:33.880
And I think you can see that.
我想你看得出来。

1705
01:17:33.980 --> 01:17:34.640
You can see that
你能看出来

1706
01:17:34.640 --> 01:17:36.360
with the big columns in the room.
通过房间里的大柱子。

1707
01:17:36.560 --> 01:17:37.660
And those windows,
而那些窗户，

1708
01:17:37.920 --> 01:17:38.220
to me,
